{"id":"88dea30e48fadc7f","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas.md","title":"文字、至多三文字子句与 3-CNF","display":"df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas — 文字、至多三文字子句与 3-CNF","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas","aliases":["73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas"],"display":"df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas — 文字、至多三文字子句与 3-CNF","depends_on":["[[73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.3, print pp. 448–458; PDF pp. 470–480; at-most-three local syntax variant","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Theorems 13.2–13.3, pp. 328–330; scans 336–338; local at-most-three encoding","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas — 文字、至多三文字子句与 3-CNF"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3eb1d15e0e8f389d\" href=\"?note=3eb1d15e0e8f389d\" title=\"73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat\">73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.3, print pp. 448–458; PDF pp. 470–480; at-most-three local syntax variant"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorems 13.2–13.3, pp. 328–330; scans 336–338; local at-most-three encoding"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=(\\operatorname{bcode},\\operatorname{bdecode})\">\\(\\mathcal B=(\\operatorname{bcode},\\operatorname{bdecode})\\)</span>；使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3eb1d15e0e8f389d\" href=\"?note=3eb1d15e0e8f389d\" title=\"73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat\">73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat</a> 的自由布尔项构造子、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{BoolForm}\">\\(\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\)</span>；词和有限项列表见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(U\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf C\">\\(\\mathbf C\\)</span> 为子句列表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}clause\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}formulas}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{Lit}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Var}\\cup\\{\\neg p:p\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\\qquad\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\le3}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j=1}^3\\mathsf{Lit}^j\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}clause\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}formulas}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{Lit}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Var}\\cup\\{\\neg p:p\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\\qquad\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\le3}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j=1}^3\\mathsf{Lit}^j\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}clause\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}formulas}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Disj}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{Disj}(U\\langle\\varphi\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Disj}(U)\\vee\\varphi,\\quad\\operatorname{Conj}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\top,\\quad\\operatorname{Conj}(U\\langle\\varphi\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Conj}(U)\\wedge\\varphi\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}clause\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}formulas}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Disj}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{Disj}(U\\langle\\varphi\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Disj}(U)\\vee\\varphi,\\quad\\operatorname{Conj}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\top,\\quad\\operatorname{Conj}(U\\langle\\varphi\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Conj}(U)\\wedge\\varphi\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}clause\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}formulas}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{ThreeCNF}_{\\le}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Conj}(\\langle\\operatorname{Disj}(\\mathbf C(i)):0\\le i&lt;|\\mathbf C|\\rangle):\\mathbf C\\in(\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\le3})^{&lt;\\omega}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}clause\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}formulas}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{ThreeCNF}_{\\le}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Conj}(\\langle\\operatorname{Disj}(\\mathbf C(i)):0\\le i&lt;|\\mathbf C|\\rangle):\\mathbf C\\in(\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\le3})^{&lt;\\omega}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}clause\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}formulas}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{ThreeSAT}_{\\mathcal B}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{ThreeCNF}_{\\le}\\land\\exists\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbf2\\;⟦\\varphi⟧_\\nu=1\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}clause\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}formulas}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{ThreeSAT}_{\\mathcal B}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{ThreeCNF}_{\\le}\\land\\exists\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbf2\\;⟦\\varphi⟧_\\nu=1\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此处 3-CNF 指每子句至多三文字。合取空列表表示真；单子句内部递归的初始假值只是固定语法包装，大小线性且可立即化简。第三版要求恰三个互异文字，不能靠重复文字填充；须用新变量构造，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"842c1db14c45597e\" href=\"?note=842c1db14c45597e\" title=\"73-thm-distinct-three-sat-padding-and-completeness\">73-thm-distinct-three-sat-padding-and-completeness</a>。SAT 子句使用固定有效布尔编码包 𝓑，取满足 BoolCoding 的同一实例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat","status":"resolved","id":"3eb1